claude: true
prompt: >
  You are working on App::Shotgun (Perl, Moose, mass upload via FTP/SFTP). Pull the
  board, pick the next actionable ticket, and implement it following
  .claude/rules/shotgun-rules.md. Delegate behavior-relevant code to the
  shotgun-worker agent if the Agent tool is available; otherwise implement directly.
  Verify with `prove -l t/` before handoff. Never release without explicit
  maintainer go-ahead.
